{"posts":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":"6a9a8a4b7fcb936adcfedf5e","text":"An eventful week comes to an end. \n\nA lot of interesting questions being raised, for example \"How will AI change DevOps/Platform Engineering?\". Focus is getting more and more on both AI, security and Sovereignity - and FOSS' role in this. I'll take one important tip from Kelsey Hightower: \"Just think!\". It will be important to have people who can think in the future as well. \n\nAnd, Marcus: I'm sorry - Kelsey used about one second to shoot down your \"kube cuddle\" with a \"It's Kube CTL, next question!\"","status":"sent","dueAt":"2026-09-04T12:00:00.000Z","channelId":"681cb313556664dc1086cbca","externalLink":"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:ugcPost:7501610200873947136","shareMode":"customScheduled","via":"buffer","assets":[{"thumbnail":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9a895008c3efde9f005996/bcba25e2f9b8eaa0f16e8138eb0db5e5.original.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","source":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9a895008c3efde9f005996/bcba25e2f9b8eaa0f16e8138eb0db5e5.original.jpg"},{"thumbnail":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9a8950fa723e07dd0173e4/f9f1cb590e6f394ff573d63d583355b4.original.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","source":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9a8950fa723e07dd0173e4/f9f1cb590e6f394ff573d63d583355b4.original.jpg"}],"metrics":[{"type":"reactions","name":"Reactions","value":0,"unit":"count"},{"type":"comments","name":"Comments","value":0,"unit":"count"}]}},{"node":{"id":"6a9801a838c8afd44753c899","text":"Container Days Hamburg 2026 is on! \n\nDifferent location, some new people, some \"old\", the same awsome vibe and so many smart people in one location!\n\nA lot of focus on Sovereign solutions this year, following the trend. BWI first out with a great talk about what they've done for Bundeswehr (German armed forces) with Open Source Software for a secure, sovereign platform.\n\nAnd of course, the mandatory Fritz-kola fridge!\n\n#cds2026 #kubernetes #containersarefun\n\n","status":"sent","dueAt":"2026-09-02T10:59:52.538Z","channelId":"681cb313556664dc1086cbca","externalLink":"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:ugcPost:7500870200171548673","shareMode":"shareNow","via":"buffer","assets":[{"thumbnail":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9800be5bf052e63a08dec0/0b62e04612eccae5141acfa8f59dc804.original.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","source":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9800be5bf052e63a08dec0/0b62e04612eccae5141acfa8f59dc804.original.jpg"},{"thumbnail":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9800c0b2997de3a407cd6c/1549bae770d84e8c8ed0b9e95e92e3c0.original.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","source":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9800c0b2997de3a407cd6c/1549bae770d84e8c8ed0b9e95e92e3c0.original.jpg"},{"thumbnail":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9800c49f49bd037b0ef301/e5058b37bf6597b5d454a1a18b374d39.original.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","source":"https://buffer-media-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/681cb21f92e4a029fa0e7ae1/6a9800c49f49bd037b0ef301/e5058b37bf6597b5d454a1a18b374d39.original.jpg"}],"metrics":[{"type":"reactions","name":"Reactions","value":10,"unit":"count"},{"type":"comments","name":"Comments","value":0,"unit":"count"},{"type":"engagementRate","name":"Eng. Rate","value":3.68,"unit":"percentage"},{"type":"impressions","name":"Impressions","value":272,"unit":"count"},{"type":"reach","name":"Reach","value":169,"unit":"count"}]}},{"node":{"id":"6a96939b687cbc363bcdbc2e","text":"Security in k8s might not be the most fun we do as platform engineers. And it's hard to find all the sources and understand why we need all of these components. \n\nThat's why I think this speak by Ozzie and Nova really needs more views! I've hardy ever learned so much attending a speak, and at the same time been entertained! And that was in a topic I was a total noob!\n\nhttps://lnkd.in/eYnFGTrb ","status":"sent","dueAt":"2026-09-01T11:51:00.000Z","channelId":"681cb313556664dc1086cbca","externalLink":"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:share:7500520677578448897","shareMode":"customScheduled","via":"buffer","assets":[],"metrics":[{"type":"reactions","name":"Reactions","value":10,"unit":"count"},{"type":"comments","name":"Comments","value":1,"unit":"count"},{"type":"engagementRate","name":"Eng. Rate","value":2.04,"unit":"percentage"},{"type":"impressions","name":"Impressions","value":539,"unit":"count"},{"type":"reach","name":"Reach","value":362,"unit":"count"}]}}],"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":true,"endCursor":"WkRFM09EZ3lOak0wTmpBd01EQT06YVRaaE9UWTVNemxpTmpnM1kySmpNell6WW1Oa1ltTXlaUT09"}}}
